  "description": "The proposal is for the erection of a single-storey rear extension to an existing two-storey semi-detached dwelling. The extension measures approximately 4.50 metres in width, set 0.2 metres away from party wall on both sides, and projects approximately 1.22 metres beyond the existing rear wall, giving a total ground floor depth of approximately 5.76 metres (That is also from the original building wall).\nThe extension is single-storey in height, with a mono-pitched lean-to roof sitting well below the existing first floor level of 2550mm. The extended ground floor accommodation provides an open-plan kitchen and dining area, replacing and enlarging the existing kitchen. With a new addition of a bedroom and toilet for visitors.\nExternal materials are proposed to match the existing dwelling, with facing brickwork and a roof covering to complement the existing finishes. ",
